// Small, realistic seed of ~10 catalogue records spanning all 5 item
// types, with Nigerian + international content. These are "reference"
// records on top of the 42,000 generated by 03_bulk_generator.js.
//
// NOTE: this file does NOT delete existing data; it ADDS to whatever is
// already in the catalogue. 03_bulk_generator.js clears the collection
// first, so if you run run_p4.sh in order, seed runs before bulk and the
// seed records survive the bulk insert (bulk only deletes if you tell
// it to — see comment in that file).
// =====================================================================

